Rochishnu,

Please read the help file more carefully and take a look at the examples.  For data that are previously superimposed, one provides a gpagen OBJECT, not just the aligned coordinates. One cannot expect bilat.symmetry to know about the sizes if they are not provided.

The examples in the help file show proper usage.

